# Atmani et al. 2020: HIPS 1.1 mm yoghurt cup, 140 C, Al plug 80 mm stroke at 1 m/s then 5 bar air; depth 67.5.
# The plug is NOT modelled (solver has none): air only. Notes: atmani2020_cup.notes.md.
sketch plan(on: xy) {
  rim = circle((0, 0), 35)
}
cav = extrude(plan, -67.5, taper: 5.920621deg)
floor = fillet(edges(of: cav.end), 5)
part = thermoform(cav, t: 1.1, material: "HIPS", tool: "female", flange: 10, shrink: ratio(0), vent: false, temperature: 140, pressure: ratio(0.5))
